<body>
<main>
  <p><a href="/">← Nyumba254</a></p>
  <h1>Delete your account</h1>
  <p>You can delete your Nyumba254 account yourself, from the website or from the Android app. Deleting is permanent.</p>

  <div class="card">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">In the app</h2>
    <p>Open <strong>Account</strong>, scroll to the bottom and tap <strong>Delete my account</strong>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">On the website</h2>
    <p>Sign in, open <strong>Profile</strong>, and choose <strong>Delete account</strong>.</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/profile">Go to my profile</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Can't sign in?</h2>
    <p>Email us from the address on your account and we will delete it for you. See <a href="/contact">Contact</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>What is deleted</h2>
  <p>Your sign-in, profile, listings, photos, saved messages, enquiries and notifications are removed.</p>
  <h2>What may be kept</h2>
  <p>Records we must keep for safety, fraud prevention or legal reasons, such as reports and payment records, may be kept for a limited time. See the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
</main>
</body>
